@page
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Services";
}

<section class="wrap narrow section">
    <h1>Services</h1>
    <p class="lead">Four things we do, and we try to do each of them properly.</p>

    <article class="svc">
        <h2>Structural design</h2>
        <p>Concrete, steel, timber and masonry. We produce calculations and drawings that a contractor can build from without calling us every day.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="svc">
        <h2>Site supervision</h2>
        <p>An engineer visits at the stages that matter: foundations, reinforcement before the pour, steel connections. Every visit ends with a short written report.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="svc">
        <h2>Condition surveys</h2>
        <p>For older buildings: what is wrong, how serious it is and what it costs to fix. We say clearly when something is fine and does not need work.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="svc">
        <h2>Design checking</h2>
        <p>Independent review of another engineer's design, for clients, banks or building authorities who want a second opinion.</p>
    </article>

    <p><a class="btn" asp-page="/Quote">Request a quote</a></p>
</section>
